<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill starts 3 medical stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill starts 3 medical stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of American Oncology Resources with near-term neutral and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage put near-term accumulate and long-term buy ratings on FPA Medical Management Inc.</p>
<p>-- Physicians Resource Group Inc was rated a near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
</text>
